blocks.en:
Decomposition. The scheduler first separates what the question resolves on ( was something announced by the cutoff ) from what it seems to ask ( what FDA decides ). That gives three sub-questions:
(i) premise check: does the drug, the Incyte licence, the Priority Review, and the Saturday PDUFA date really exist as stated;
(ii) timing: given a weekend goal date, how likely is it that FDA acts by Friday, and that the sponsor makes it public before 22:30 ET;
(iii) the decision itself: approval vs. complete response letter (CRL) vs. review extension, weighing a missed primary endpoint against a very strong secondary endpoint and FOP-specific precedent.
It forms an initial forecast ( approved 0.47, crl 0.22, extended 0.03, none 0.28) and then runs three search rounds and one critic call.

blocks.zh:
释相. 计程员首先将问题解决之处(是截断者宣布的)与它似乎提出的问题(林业发展局的决定)分开。 这就提出了三个分问题:
(一) 前提检查:如上所述,是否确实存在药物、入细胞许可证、优先审查以及星期六PDUFA日期;
(二) 时间:给出周末目标日期,FDA在星期五前行动的可能性如何,主办方在22:30ET前公布;
(三)决定本身:核准与完整的答复函(CRL)相接,与一个非常强的二级终点和FOP特有的先例相权衡,对一个被错失的主终点进行权衡.
它形成初步预测(批准0.47克勒0.22,扩展0.03,无0.28),再运行3个搜索回合和1个评论员呼叫.
